Reason: (f) The email and trusted_device options exist only with scheb/2fa-email and scheb/2fa-trusted-device, whose recipes add them, so scheb/2fa-bundle alone boots.
Evidence: scheb/2fa-bundle v8.6.1 alone fails cache:clear with: Unrecognized options "email, trusted_device" under "scheb_two_factor".

--- a/config/packages/scheb_2fa.yaml
+++ b/config/packages/scheb_2fa.yaml
@@ -3,7 +3,3 @@
     security_tokens:
         - Symfony\Component\Security\Core\Authentication\Token\UsernamePasswordToken
         - Symfony\Component\Security\Http\Authenticator\Token\PostAuthenticationToken
-    email:
-        enabled: true
-    trusted_device:
-        enabled: true
